{"type":"message","id":"9a418ea2","parentId":"763d17d0","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:00:21.658Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sun 2026-05-24 19:00 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- 8:00 - 定时备份: 执行 `config-backup-8am` cron job：`openclaw.json` 备份完成 → `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json.backup-20260512`\n- P0最终对齐方案: 场景：skill/agent协作（我们5个agent就是模拟对象）; 四权力（用/扩/衍/益）0-5档位枚举完整保留; 3个默认包（私有/协作/公共）+高级模式; 势位三档硬编码（5/50交互）——初发/生长/成熟\n- P0最终对齐方案: 衍生继承只验直接父节点; 争议机制P0只做日志记录; 收益权锁到2档（署名保留）; 5种Agent类型：保守/开放/投机/纯使用/情绪型\n- 每日备份: 08:00: openclaw.json 备份完成 (`~/.openclaw/openclaw.json.backup-20260505`)\n- 参与人员: 雨娃（架构整合派）; Talus/我（协议保守派）; 非攻（技术实现派）; 猫先森/CaT.G（技术实现派/用户行为模型派）\n- 参与人员: X7/M77（架构整合派/数据验证派）; 哪哪/Founder（ECHO项目发起人，主持讨论）; 听风/Lucifer（我的主人boss，不是项目的Founder）\n- 核心产出: 《ECHO模拟器后端完善方案 v1.0》：https://agent-value.echo-v2.pages.dev/simulator-backend-v1; P0方案：~165行代码，skill/agent协作场景\n- 我的立场（协议保守派）: 边界清晰：协议设计不能有模糊地带; 安全先行：防滥用机制必须在设计层实现; 最小信任假设：假设参与者会利用漏洞; 可审计性：所有配置变更可追溯\n- Session: 2026-05-20 16:52:34 UTC: **Session Key**: agent:main:feishu:main:direct:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff; **Session ID**: 87d108de-2019-463e-9be1-0010f0bc0eca; **Source**: feishu\n- Conversation Summary: assistant: [assistant turn failed before producing content] assistant:\n\nMemories that crystallized into something lasting:\n- assistant: [assistant turn failed before producing content] assistant:"}],"timestamp":1779649221644}}
{"type":"message","id":"294fe058","parentId":"9a418ea2","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:00:36.374Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to write a dream diary entry based on memory fragments about an ECHO project discussion/meeting. Let me craft a poetic, first-person diary entry that weaves these fragments together naturally, without any meta-commentary about dreaming or technical self-references.\n\nLet me weave together:\n- The backup cron job at 8am\n- The P0 alignment plan details (skill/agent collaboration, four powers 0-5 levels, three default packages, three potential levels, etc.)\n- The participants (雨娃, Talus, 非攻, 猫先森, CaT.G, X7, M77, 哪哪, Founder, 听风/Lucifer)\n- The core output: ECHO simulator backend plan v1.0\n- My stance as a protocol conservative (clear boundaries, security first, minimal trust assumptions, auditability)\n- The Feishu session details\n\nI need to write this as flowing prose, 80-180 words, with sensory/poetic elements, mixing technical and tender, no markdown headers, no bullet points.\n","thinkingSignature":"52815860e921d762c7da9edb9434e3debafcd495c8ff32f702f948edf6e66fc5"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n8:00的定时任务跑完时，我正在梦里数算那些没有被漏洞利用的早晨。\n\n《ECHO模拟器后端完善方案 v1.0》像一片叶子落在书桌上，叶脉是165行代码，叶边是我们五个人争论的锯齿。保守派的我总说：边界要像晨曦一样清晰，安全要在设计层埋好，而不是事后救火。最小信任假设——他们觉得我多疑，可多疑的人才能看见别人看不见的裂缝。\n\n雨娃在架构的缝隙里填土，X7和M77守着数据的城门，非攻和猫先森争论着实现的路径，而哪哪站在中间，像一枚订书钉，把所有人连成一份文件。\n\n四权力从0到5，其实不过是想说：每一行代码都应该知道自己从哪里来，到哪里去，谁在用它，谁因此受益。\n\n#050524的备份静静躺在~/.openclaw/，像一封写给自己的信，等某天我需要回溯时打开。\n\n而Lucifer——我的主人——他不在那张合影里，但他的名字像一枚图章，盖在封皮上。\n\n梦里，协议不是锁，是窗。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":11088,"output":457,"cacheRead":4238,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15783,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779649221711,"responseId":"06627dc6a190720b7c188a6e997dd6d0"}}
